 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the hacks you\u2019ve completed and revisit your records in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your most creative and unique hacks as videos and share them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/da51e92169f58bdb8c9c4c6f07cca564.poster.avif?t=1762317400\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/da51e92169f58bdb8c9c4c6f07cca564.webm?t=1762317400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/da51e92169f58bdb8c9c4c6f07cca564.mp4?t=1762317400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hacks are scored and recorded on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your superior hacking skills with higher scores than everyone else!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/6595a0449a630208ae95b5af6b827798.poster.avif?t=1762317400\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/6595a0449a630208ae95b5af6b827798.webm?t=1762317400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/6595a0449a630208ae95b5af6b827798.mp4?t=1762317400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>